<title>USA: UOL Publishing acquires Texas training firm.</title>
<headline>UOL Publishing acquires Texas training firm.</headline>
<dateline>FALLS CHURCH, Va. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>UOL Publishing Inc said Monday that it has acquired Cognitive Training Associates Inc of Waxahachie, Texas, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Cognitive Training provides technology-based corporate training.</p>
<p>In September UOL filed a registration statement for an initial public offering.</p>
